            <note corresp="#d837-f1" n="39" xml:id="d837-f1-content">
                <p>Treaty signed at Peking, January 20, 1925, by the Soviet Ambassador in China and
                    the Japanese Minister in China; League of Nations Treaty Series, vol. <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">xxxiv</hi>, p. 31.</p>
            </note>
